ndard paper said it suspected state involvement in an attempt to intimidate reporters.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU summons Russian envoy over failed Leipzig drone attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ff217872463f76262434c9c1671f0e160016e2dbaf2b384cff387a477f3cf074</id><updated>2026-09-03T04:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T08:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-summons-russian-envoy-over-failed-leipzig-drone-attack/a-78687280--165732ae8dab.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-summons-russian-envoy-over-failed-leipzig-drone-attack/a-78687280?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU's foreign policy chief Kaja Kallas said the attempted attack had "all the hallmarks of state-sponsored terrorism." She said the EU was summoning a Russian envoy, with France announcing a similar step.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What really helps Europe deal with drought</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5c02e8af7e620b1be5399775a23f7ed201e96827cb04f090faae5d6dc43f7501</id><updated>2026-09-03T04:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T07:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-really-helps-europe-deal-with-drought/a-78577712--d183cadee76b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-really-helps-europe-deal-with-drought/a-78577712?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fix leaks, or ban pools? As European countries prepare for hotter, drier years to come, here's what the data says about how to really save water.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Charlie Kirk murder suspect to face potential death penalty</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3b442a8a318e019a8f21eb695f9e4d6ca9c6a64f21a2fa783f60333ddad82ef8</id><updated>2026-09-03T04:43:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T07:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com